      "content": "2. Himalayan River System"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "0eeozir",
      "content": "The Himalayan rivers originate from glaciers in the Himalayan mountain range. They carry water throughout the year and form large river valleys and floodplains."
